#. <CLT 4>簡素な雰囲気の個室に…金箔の模擬刀…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only thing in my room is...a fake sword covered in\n"
"gold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違和感以外のなにものでもない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All it does is make me feel that much more\n"
"uncomfortable.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、今日はまだ時間もあるし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, there's still plenty of time left in the day.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じっとしている気分じゃない。
#. どこかに行ってみようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really don't feel like just sitting here. Maybe I'll\n"
"take a look around...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このドアは、建付けが悪いんだったな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This door doesn't quite fit in the doorframe.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開け方のコツ、忘れないようにしないと。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'll have to make sure and remember the trick to\n"
"opening it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、このモニター…！
#. どこの会社が作ってるんだよ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What kind of monitor is this!? Who would even make\n"
"this kind of thing!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ社って書いてある。
#. ディティールにこだわってんな…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It has \"Monokuma Co.\" written across it. I guess\n"
"they've covered all the details..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラに見られてると思うと…
#. まったく落ち着かないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I think about being constantly watched on these\n"
"cameras...it just stresses me out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特になんの仕掛けもない…
#. 普通のゴミ箱みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just an everyday trash can. I don't see any kind of\n"
"trapdoor or hidden compartments or anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A desk with a few drawers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よくある学生用って感じだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the kind of thing any student would have.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a notepad.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんがボクに言ってくれた言葉でも
#. メモっておこうかな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should write down what Sayaka told me earlier.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…工具セットだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a toolkit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ新品の未開封品みたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be brand-new. It's still in the shrink-wrap.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…粘着テープクリーナーだな。
#. 掃除はご自由にって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's some kind of lint roller. I guess we're supposed\n"
"to clean up after ourselves...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>簡素な雰囲気の個室に…金箔の模擬刀…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only thing in my room is...a fake sword covered in\n"
"gold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違和感以外のなにものでもない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All it does is make me feel that much more\n"
"uncomfortable.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>簡素な雰囲気の個室に…金箔の模擬刀…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only thing in my room is...a fake sword covered in\n"
"gold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違和感以外のなにものでもない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All it does is make me feel that much more\n"
"uncomfortable.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この鉄板…
#. ここは牢獄じゃないんだぞ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's with this metal barricade? This is supposed to\n"
"be a school, not a prison...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この鉄板…
#. ここは牢獄じゃないんだぞ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's with this metal barricade? This is supposed to\n"
"be a school, not a prison...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0031 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
